"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"\n"
".. |badge1| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/maturity-Beta-yellow.png\n"
"    :target: https://odoo-community.org/page/development-status\n"
"    :alt: Beta\n"
".. |badge2| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/license-LGPL--3-blue.png\n"
"    :target: http://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0-standalone.html\n"
"    :alt: License: LGPL-3\n"
".. |badge3| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/github-OCA%2Fevent-lightgray.png?logo=github\n"
"    :target: https://github.com/OCA/event/tree/19.0/event_waitlist\n"
"    :alt: OCA/event\n"
".. |badge4| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/weblate-Translate%20me-F47D42.png\n"
"    :target: https://translation.odoo-community.org/projects/event-19-0/event-19-0-event_waitlist\n"
"    :alt: Translate me on Weblate\n"
".. |badge5| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/runboat-Try%20me-875A7B.png\n"
"    :target: https://runboat.odoo-community.org/builds?repo=OCA/event&target_branch=19.0\n"
"    :alt: Try me on Runboat\n"
"\n"
"|badge1| |badge2| |badge3| |badge4| |badge5|\n"
"\n"
"Waiting list for sold-out events (courses, classes, workshops).\n"
"\n"
"When an event or a ticket is fully booked, people can join a waiting\n"
"list. As soon as a seat becomes free (a registration is cancelled,\n"
"archived or deleted, or the capacity is increased), the waiting list\n"
"moves up automatically, in one of two modes chosen per event:\n"
"\n"
"-  **Offer the seat** (default): the first person receives an email with\n"
"   a link and has a deadline (12 hours by default) to accept. The seat\n"
"   is reserved for them meanwhile and cannot be booked by anyone else.\n"
"   If the deadline passes or the person declines, the next person gets\n"
"   the offer.\n"
"-  **Register automatically**: the first person is registered right away\n"
"   and receives the normal registration confirmation.\n"
"\n"
"Other features:\n"
"\n"
"-  One waiting list per event; an entry may target a specific ticket\n"
"   and, for events with several time slots, a specific slot (each slot\n"
"   has its own queue and its seats are held separately).\n"
"-  People asking for several seats keep their position; a freed seat\n"
"   goes to the first person whose request fits.\n"
"-  No offers after the event has started; the deadline never goes beyond\n"
"   the start of the event.\n"
"-  Editable email templates: entry confirmed (with the position), seat\n"
"   offered, seat confirmed, offer expired. Every email contains a link\n"
"   to leave the list.\n"
"-  Token links for attendees (no record ids in URLs). Links in emails\n"
"   only open a page; actions require a click on that page, so email\n"
"   scanners cannot accept or decline seats by following links.\n"
"-  Duplicate entries (same email, same event) are refused.\n"
"-  Seat assignment is serialized per event, so two cancellations at the\n"
"   same time can never give away more seats than are free or offer one\n"
"   seat twice.\n"
"-  Entries are deleted automatically a configurable number of days after\n"
"   the event (data protection).\n"
"-  Every step is logged in the chatter of the event.\n"
"\n"
"The website part (sign-up form, button instead of \"Sold Out\") is in\n"
"``website_event_waitlist``.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"Open an event, tab **Waiting List**:\n"
"\n"
"-  **Waiting List**: turn it on.\n"
"-  **When a Seat Becomes Free**: *Offer the seat (with deadline)* or\n"
"   *Register automatically*.\n"
"-  **Offer Deadline (hours)**: time to accept an offered seat (default\n"
"   12).\n"
"-  **Maximum Waiting List Length**: 0 = unlimited.\n"
"-  **Delete Entries After (days)**: retention after the end of the\n"
"   event.\n"
"\n"
"The emails can be adapted in *Settings > Technical > Email Templates*\n"
"(search for \"Waiting List\").\n"
"\n"
"Two scheduled actions are installed: *expire offers and move up* (every\n"
"10 minutes) and *delete entries of past events* (daily).\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"-  The smart button **Waiting List** on the event shows the list in\n"
"   queue order. Reorder entries with drag and drop.\n"
"-  **Move up** on an entry offers a seat to (or registers) this person\n"
"   right away, if seats are free. **Move up waiting list** on the event\n"
"   gives all free seats to the list (this also happens automatically).\n"
"-  On an offered entry, staff can **Confirm seat** or **Decline seat**\n"
"   on behalf of the person.\n"
"-  *Events > Reporting > Waiting Lists* shows the entries of all events.\n"
"\n"
"Bug Tracker\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Bugs are tracked on `GitHub Issues <https://github.com/OCA/event/issues>`_.\n"
"In case of trouble, please check there if your issue has already been reported.\n"
"If you spotted it first, help us to smash it by providing a detailed and welcomed\n"
"`feedback <https://github.com/OCA/event/issues/new?body=module:%20event_waitlist%0Aversion:%2019.0%0A%0A**Steps%20to%20reproduce**%0A-%20...%0A%0A**Current%20behavior**%0A%0A**Expected%20behavior**>`_.\n"
"\n"
"Do not contact contributors directly about support or help with technical issues.\n"
"\n"
